    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 22.21,
      "end": 23.399,
      "en": "almost like a little kid!",
      "zh": "那第一句該說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 24.37,
      "end": 25.46,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "首先，"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 25.46,
      "end": 27.809,
      "en": "They just wanted a coffee!",
      "zh": "一定要先跟店員打招呼！"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 27.809,
      "end": 28.679,
      "en": "What should you say first?",
      "zh": "點餐前先說「嗨，"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 29.71,
      "end": 31.03,
      "en": "First,",
      "zh": "你好嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 31.03,
      "end": 32.659,
      "en": "always greet the worker!",
      "zh": "絕對不要一開口就點餐，"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 32.659,
      "end": 33.329,
      "en": "Say,",
      "zh": "打斷了人家的招呼！"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 33.329,
      "end": 33.969,
      "en": "\"Hi,",
      "zh": "了解！"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 33.969,
      "end": 35.24,
      "en": "how are you?\"",
      "zh": "那最禮貌的點餐說法有哪些？"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 35.24,
      "end": 35.7,
      "en": "before you order.",
      "zh": "三個簡單句型！"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 37.039,
      "end": 39.079,
      "en": "Never cut off their\ngreeting with food!",
      "zh": "第一種，"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 39.979,
      "end": 41.32,
      "en": "Got it!",
      "zh": "說「請問能給我一杯拿鐵嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 41.32,
      "end": 43.78,
      "en": "What are the best\npolite ways to order?",
      "zh": "在美國聽起來超友善的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 44.49,
      "end": 47.28,
      "en": "Three easy templates!",
      "zh": "「請問能給我一杯拿鐵嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 47.28,
      "end": 48.09,
      "en": "First,",
      "zh": "那第二種呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 48.09,
      "end": 49.079,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "第二種，"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 49.079,
      "end": 50.259,
      "en": "\"Could I get a latte,",
      "zh": "用「I'd like」語氣比較溫和："
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 50.259,
      "end": 50.439,
      "en": "please?",
      "zh": "「我想要一杯拿鐵，"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 51.92,
      "end": 53.63,
      "en": "That sounds super friendly in America.",
      "zh": "麻煩了。」"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 54.469,
      "end": 55.929,
      "en": "Could I get a latte,",
      "zh": "第三種，"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 55.929,
      "end": 57.06,
      "en": "please?\"",
      "zh": "當你準備好了，"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 57.06,
      "end": 58.14,
      "en": "What is number two?",
      "zh": "可以說「我點一杯拿鐵，"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 58.859,
      "end": 59.659,
      "en": "Second,",
      "zh": "謝謝！」"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 59.659,
      "end": 63.369,
      "en": "use \"I'd like\" for a softer tone:",
      "zh": "如果店員問\n「在這裡用還是外帶？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 63.369,
      "end": 64.48,
      "en": "\"I'd like a latte,",
      "zh": "就笑著說「在這裡用，"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 64.48,
      "end": 64.7,
      "en": "please.",
      "zh": "謝謝」或「外帶，"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 66.329,
      "end": 66.84,
      "en": "Third,",
      "zh": "謝謝」就好！"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 66.84,
      "end": 67.92,
      "en": "when you are ready,",
      "zh": "超級實用！"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 67.92,
      "end": 68.709,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "所以黃金法則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 68.709,
      "end": 69.909,
      "en": "\"I'll have a latte,",
      "zh": "黃金法則："
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 69.909,
      "end": 70.109,
      "en": "thanks!",
      "zh": "絕對不要以「I want」開頭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 71.079,
      "end": 72.359,
      "en": "What if the barista asks,",
      "zh": "永遠先打招呼，"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 72.359,
      "end": 74.069,
      "en": "\"For here or to go?",
      "zh": "然後再用「Could I get」\n或「I'd like」！"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 74.969,
      "end": 76.67,
      "en": "Just smile and say,",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 76.67,
      "end": 77.15,
      "en": "\"For here,",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 77.15,
      "end": 77.45,
      "en": "please,\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 77.45,
      "end": 79.489,
      "en": "or \"To go,",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 79.489,
      "end": 79.689,
      "en": "thanks!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 80.04,
      "end": 82.34,
      "en": "Super useful!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 82.34,
      "end": 84.79,
      "en": "So what is the golden rule?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 85.709,
      "end": 87.42,
      "en": "Golden rule:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 87.42,
      "end": 89.18,
      "en": "Never open with \"I want.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 90.079,
      "end": 91.579,
      "en": "Always greet first,",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 91.579,
      "end": 93.04,
      "en": "then use \"Could I get\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
